alg2a 
 Algorithm 2    Implementable Proximal BPS 
 
 
               1: 
              
              
             Input:   X_{0}\sim\mu_{0} , where
 D_{2}(\mu_{0}\|\mu)\leq\Delta 

 
 
               2: 
              
              
             Parameters: 
 \eta,T,a,\rho,\bar{\lambda},Q_{\rm prox} 

 
 
               3: 
              
              
            Draw  Z_{0}\sim\mathcal{N}(0,I)  independently and set
 Y_{0}\leftarrow X_{0}+\sqrt{\eta}Z_{0} 

 
 
               4: 
              
              
             for   k=0,\ldots,T-1   do 

 
 
               5: 
              
              
               Y_{k+1}\leftarrow 2X_{k}-Y_{k} 

 
 
               6: 
              
              
               \widehat{x}_{+}\leftarrow\textsc{FirstOrderProx}(X_{k},Y_{k+1},Q_{\rm prox}) 

 
 
               7: 
              
              
               if   FirstOrderProx  reports failure  then 

 
 
               8: 
              
              
                return   X_{k} 

 
 
               9: 
              
              
               end   if 
 
 
               10: 
              
              
               \widetilde{X}\leftarrow\textsc{ApproximateRGO}(Y_{k+1},\widehat{x}_{+},a) 

 
 
               11: 
              
              
              Draw  B_{k}\sim\operatorname{Bernoulli}(\rho)  independently

 
 
               12: 
              
              
               if   B_{k}=1   then 

 
 
               13: 
              
              
                X_{k+1}\leftarrow\widetilde{X} 

 
 
               14: 
              
              
               else 
 
 
               15: 
              
              
               Query  \nabla V(\widetilde{X}) 

 
 
               16: 
              
              
                X_{k+1}\leftarrow\textsc{CappedHalfTurn}(X_{k},Y_{k+1},\widetilde{X},\bar{\lambda}) 
using  Algorithm   1 

 
 
               17: 
              
              
               end   if 
 
 
               18: 
              
              
             end   for 
 
 
               19: 
              
              
             return   X_{T} 

 
 

