A3.SS2.p5 
 The main result of this subsection is the following estimate. 

A3.SS2.p5.1 The main result of this subsection is the following estimate.
A3.Thmtheorem2 
 Proposition C.2   (Weighted half-turn estimate for affine functions) . 
 
 Assume  \beta\eta\leq 1/2 . Uniformly in  y , every
 \ell_{a,y}:w\mapsto a^{\top}(w-\bar{w}_{y})  satisfies 
 

 
  
 \|(I+\mathsf{H}_{y})\ell_{a,y}\|_{L^{2}(q_{y})}^{2}\leq C\beta\eta\,a^{\top}(I-\Sigma_{y})a\,. 
  
 (C.11) 
 
 More generally, suppose that  y\mapsto a_{y}  is measurable and
 \int a_{y}^{\top}(I-\Sigma_{y})a_{y}\,\pi_{\eta}^{Y}(\mathrm{d}y)<\infty , and define 
 

 
  
 \ell(x,y)\coloneqq a_{y}^{\top}\Bigl(\frac{x-y}{\sqrt{\eta}}-\bar{w}_{y}\Bigr)\,. 
  
 
 Then,  \ell\in\mathfrak{H}_{\perp}  and 
 

 
  
 \|(I+\mathsf{H}_{\perp\perp})\ell\|^{2}\leq C\beta\eta\int a_{y}^{\top}(I-\Sigma_{y})a_{y}\,\pi_{\eta}^{Y}(\mathrm{d}y)\,. 
  
 
 

